{"4148590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wild West Frontier", "steam_appid": 4148590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARVESTING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you can make anything, you'll need to gather the raw materials. Or, if you are fortunate enough, you'll come across a lovely stash left behind by some poor unfortunate soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRAFTING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that you have the means, you can make things to improve your lot. Tools and weapons, clothing and gear to aid you in your further adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILDING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've acquired a load of logs or a kiln and now how the means to make a little house, or are you going further and building a farm, or even a fort!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FARMING, FISHING, AND COOKING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just started out and have nothing to eat. Find a stream and tickle some fish, or if you have the means make a cane rod, dig up some bate, and pray for a bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're further on in your adventures and now have a farm, plant and grow all kinds of tasty goodies: berries, potatoes, onions and carrots, and many, many more to stuff your larder or even sell if you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming produce and fish aplenty, now fire up that oven and get a cooking. You can eat plenty of things raw if you like, but if you have a fire, a pot, or even an oven, then why not make use of the many recipes and cook some wholesome grub for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADVENTURING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is vast with plenty to explore, creatures to hunt and tame and people both good and bad to test your mettle as you travel throughout the land.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARVESTING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you can make anything, you'll need to gather the raw materials. Or, if you are fortunate enough, you'll come across a lovely stash left behind by some poor unfortunate soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRAFTING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that you have the means, you can make things to improve your lot. Tools and weapons, clothing and gear to aid you in your further adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILDING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've acquired a load of logs or a kiln and now how the means to make a little house, or are you going further and building a farm, or even a fort!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FARMING, FISHING, AND COOKING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just started out and have nothing to eat. Find a stream and tickle some fish, or if you have the means make a cane rod, dig up some bate, and pray for a bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're further on in your adventures and now have a farm, plant and grow all kinds of tasty goodies: berries, potatoes, onions and carrots, and many, many more to stuff your larder or even sell if you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming produce and fish aplenty, now fire up that oven and get a cooking. You can eat plenty of things raw if you like, but if you have a fire, a pot, or even an oven, then why not make use of the many recipes and cook some wholesome grub for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADVENTURING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is vast with plenty to explore, creatures to hunt and tame and people both good and bad to test your mettle as you travel throughout the land.</p>", "short_description": "Wild West Frontier is a single and multiplayer survival game, set in the wild west era of the USA. Enter a vast, open-world sandbox and play together with friends and strangers as you fight to survive and thrive against the elements, creatures and people you encounter throughout your travels.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148590/cb79341bbc12916ff4e700626d99c87f7bf83e14/header.jpg?t=1765557635", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148590/03a4129a83d553e7da2d21215f6a8b5fd16f1cc9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765557635", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148590/03a4129a83d553e7da2d21215f6a8b5fd16f1cc9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765557635", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or Intel Core i5-10400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5600X or Intel Core i7-11700F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 or AMD Radeon RX 6700 or Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Min